# ---- Terraform ----
.terraform/
.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
tfplan
tfplan-*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
